Sorry, one more thing--you absolutely must validate that input$starttime and input$endtime are valid date/time strings, do this in the startime and endtime reactives. If they're not valid, either call stop("Invalid date/time") to fail with an error, or req(FALSE) to fail silently. If you don't do this, it will be possible for someone to compromise your database using SQL injection <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SQL_injection>.

