Subject: RadioButtons and checkBoxGroup do not work in modules when they are updated
Message-ID: <7zqkNhw6yZs.4fVqBJzuAwAJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/shiny-discuss/c/7zqkNhw6yZs/m/4fVqBJzuAwAJ>
